@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us - Fargo Spa and Wellness</PageTitle>

<section class="catalog-header">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
        <h1 class="section-title">About Fargo Spa &amp; Wellness</h1>
        <p class="catalog-subtitle">A calm, welcoming space built around one idea: everyone deserves a place to slow down.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="services-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="auth-card about-story-card">
                <h2 class="contact-card-title">Who we are</h2>
                <p class="about-body-text">
                    Fargo Spa &amp; Wellness offers massage, body treatments, facials, and nail care in a
                    relaxed, no-rush environment. Our providers focus on listening first &mdash; every visit
                    starts with a conversation about what you actually need, not a script.
                </p>
                <p class="about-body-text">
                    We're a small, local team. Booking, service notes, and provider schedules all run
                    through the same system so nothing gets lost between the front desk and the treatment
                    room.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="auth-card about-story-card">
                <h2 class="contact-card-title">About this project</h2>
                <p class="about-body-text">
                    Fargo Spa &amp; Wellness is a full-stack booking platform built as a team project for
                    CSCI 213 (Software Engineering), not a real business. It's built with ASP.NET Core
                    Blazor Server, Entity Framework Core, and a Brevo-backed transactional email pipeline,
                    following a Scrum process tracked in Jira across the sprint.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="about-team-heading">Our team</h2>
        <div class="about-team-grid">
            <div class="auth-card about-team-card">
                <p class="about-team-name">George Tannious</p>
                <p class="about-team-role">Product Owner &amp; Developer</p>
                <p class="about-body-text">
                    Owned backlog refinement, acceptance criteria, and business policy decisions, and built
                    out the client-facing booking flow, authentication, admin foundations, and contact/
                    information pages.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="auth-card about-team-card">
                <p class="about-team-name">Moses Francis</p>
                <p class="about-team-role">Developer</p>
                <p class="about-body-text">
                    Built out the Provider Portal, staff scheduling and availability tools, service catalog
                    and testimonial admin management, and a pass of UI polish across the admin experience.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
